 font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">さてさて！<ruby>先日<rt>せんじつ</rt></ruby>のリアルミーグリ、きてくださった<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>にありがとうございました！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">どうでしたでしょうか〜？</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>いお<ruby>洋服<rt>ようふく</rt></ruby>や<ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きでよくしているポニーテール、<ruby>髪<rt>かみ</rt></ruby><ruby>留<rt>と</rt></ruby>めは<ruby>岸<rt>きし</rt></ruby>くんに<ruby>誕生<rt>たんじょう</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>び</rt></ruby>プレゼントにもらった<ruby>髪<rt>かみ</rt></ruby><ruby>飾<rt>かざ</rt></ruby>り</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">どれも<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>に<ruby>褒<rt>ほ</rt></ruby>めていただいてとっても<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しかったです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2023-09-21/52348_1.jpg\" alt=\"beauty_1695284846553.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">また<ruby>次<rt>つぎ</rt></ruby>のリアルミーグリまで<ruby>待ち遠<rt>まちどお</rt></ruby>しいですが、<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>にお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いできる<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しみにしております</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">そして！そろそろ<ruby>電車<rt>でんしゃ</rt></ruby>が<ruby>愛知<rt>あいち</rt></ruby>に<ruby>到着<rt>とうちゃく</rt></ruby>しそうですね</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>今回<rt>こんかい</rt></ruby>はどんなライブになるのでしょうか</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">ワクワクがとまりません！<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby><ruby>気<rt>き</rt></ruby>をつけていらっしゃってください</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">そして！<ruby>大<rt>おお</rt></ruby>いに<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しんでいっていただけると<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しい<ruby>限<rt>かぎ</rt></ruby>りです</span><span class=\"s2\">…</span><span class=\"s1\">！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2023-09-21/52348_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4716.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>研修生<rt>けんしゅうせい</rt></ruby><ruby>時代<rt>じだい</rt></ruby>の<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>　<ruby>懐<rt>なつ</rt></ruby>かしいなぁ</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">《<ruby>一<rt>いち</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby><ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>今日<rt>きょう</rt></ruby>》</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>一<rt>いち</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>ねん</rt></ruby><ruby>前<rt>まえ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>今日<rt>きょう</rt></ruby>、<ruby>我々<rt>われわれ</rt></ruby><ruby>四<rt>よん</rt></ruby><ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>のティザームービーが<ruby>公開<rt>こうかい</rt></ruby>されましたね。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>、<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たち<ruby>四<rt>よん</rt></ruby><ruby>期生<rt>きせい</rt></ruby>を<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きになってくださってありがとうございます。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>にお<ruby>会<rt>あ</rt></ruby>いできて<ruby>本当<rt>ほんとう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>嬉<rt>うれ</rt></ruby>しいです。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めてだらけの<ruby>一<rt>いち</rt></ruby><ruby>年間<rt>ねんかん</rt></ruby>、たくさんの<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めての<ruby>経験<rt>けいけん</rt></ruby>と、たくさんのまだ<ruby>出会<rt>であ</rt></ruby>ったことのない<ruby>感情<rt>かんじょう</rt></ruby>に<ruby>出会<rt>であ</rt></ruby>いました。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">それらは<ruby>全<rt>すべ</rt></ruby>て<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>たちの<ruby>糧<rt>かて</rt></ruby>となってこれからに<ruby>繋<rt>つな</rt></ruby>げられるはずです。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">どれもこれも、<ruby>皆様<rt>みなさま</rt></ruby>のおかげです。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">これからもよろしくお<ruby>願<rt>ねが</rt></ruby>いいたします！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">それではまた。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/shogenji.yoko/2023-09-21/52348_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_4715.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ドキュメンタリー<ruby>動画<rt>どうが</rt></ruby>の。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 22px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">#yokoblog</span></p><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div>\n\n\n                    ",
